# The declared witness set. A witness is a test whose job is to FAIL when a
# specific rule stops working -- not merely to pass.
#
# Every file listed here should carry `//@ sabotage: <ENV_KNOB>` naming what
# makes it fall. A witness with no knob has never failed, and a test that has
# never failed has not measured anything. Founder ruling 2026-08-20: freeze the
# count that lack one, and fail the next.
#
# One path per line. Globs allowed.
tests/run-pass/r1_i256_lorenz_peak.sio
tests/run-pass/r1_i512_lorenz_peak.sio
tests/run-pass/mod_effect_declared.sio
tests/compile-fail/mod_effect_propagates.sio
